{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Ocean Escape 是一款只提供海洋聲音的播放工具，適合睡前放鬆、閱讀或需要安靜專注的人士。程式收錄三段自然音景，開啟後一按即可播放，操作簡單直接。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，安裝後即可離線使用。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-137.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>三種海洋音景離線播放</h2>\n<p>App 已內置三種海洋音景：柔和海浪、海浪配合雨聲與暴風海面，毋須下載或連接網絡即可播放。鎖上螢幕後聲音仍會繼續，並可在鎖定畫面暫停或繼續。另備 15、30、60 分鐘睡眠計時，結束前會逐漸淡出。介面不設連續打卡或廣告，純粹用作背景聲。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-413-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-414-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-415-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-416-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-417-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Ocean Escape: Sleep Sounds</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/ocean-escape-sleep-sounds/id6811227486?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T15:41:51.883952+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":308,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T15:29:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T05:21:30.697258+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T15:38:38.029505+00:00","content_hash":"9d6cb3daea9d87971cfd624430bc59f60a10dac7c58d22d7b33ebadf3cc5137f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}